# Ignore everything
*

# Essential project files
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!Makefile
!install.sh
!install_test.sh
!.go-version
!LICENSE
!azure-pipelines.yml
!Dockerfile
!.gitignore
!**/AGENTS.md
!**/FEATURE.md
!**/CLAUDE.md
# WORKER.md is per-worktree scratch state (gss feature worker add seeds it);
# keep it local-only so it never lands in a PR or the main branch.

# CI hygiene config (issue #46 phase 1). These are repo-root linter configs
# read by editors, golangci-lint, shellcheck, and markdownlint-cli2. They MUST
# be opt-in explicitly because the leading `*` rule above would otherwise hide
# them silently.
!.editorconfig
!.golangci.yml
!.shellcheckrc
!.markdownlint.jsonc
!.ci-baseline-issues.md

# Repository Structure Exceptions
!.github/
!.github/**
!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!opt/
!opt/**
!src/
!src/**
!sdk/
!sdk/**
# Retired-but-kept artifacts (e.g. the old AHK Copilot-key voice macro). Tracked
# so we can restore them later; see archive/README.md.
!archive/
!archive/**

# Local Binary Zone (opt/bin)
# We ignore everything in opt/bin except for the registry documentation and a
# few committed, hand-maintained tools (locally built binaries stay ignored).
opt/bin/*
!opt/bin/AGENTS.md
!opt/bin/CLAUDE.md
!opt/bin/pkg-install
!opt/bin/pkg-install-apt
!opt/bin/pkg-install-brew
!opt/bin/install_windows.sh
!opt/bin/sshd-setup
!opt/bin/claude-rc-boot
# WSL docker shims: real executables (not aliases) so make/scripts resolve
# docker even in non-interactive shells (see opt/profiles/.bash_aliases).
!opt/bin/docker
!opt/bin/docker-compose
# Test drivers for the committed opt/bin tools (issue #46 phase 2)
!opt/bin/pkg-install_test.sh
!opt/bin/sshd-setup_test.sh
!opt/bin/claude-rc-boot_test.sh

# Opt Subdirectory Configuration
opt/.DS_Store
opt/rbenv
opt/XMind_Linux_64bit/
opt/clawdad/
opt/nano/
opt/google-cloud-sdk/

# Documentation
# docs/ is tracked so guides are available on all machines.
# To keep a doc local-only, list it explicitly below (e.g. docs/my-private-notes.md).
!docs/
!docs/**

# Source Code Build Artifacts
sdk/tmux-mgr/tmux-mgr
coverage/

# System & Local Settings (Always Private)
!system/
!system/**
!ai/
!ai/**
# Per-host Claude/Antigravity settings stay local; install.sh seeds them from the
# tracked .template files so each machine can customize without leaking values.
ai/claude/settings.json
# Per-host gws (Google Workspace CLI) config + OAuth client secret stay local;
# seeded from the tracked ai/gws/*.template files. client_secret.json is a
# credential and must never be committed.
ai/gws/config.json
ai/gws/client_secret.json
.custom_alias
*.swp

# Tool Specific Configurations
!.config/
!.config/terminator/
!.config/terminator/config
